sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor User
participant API as API service
participant PreferencesController as UserNotificationPreferencesController
participant AccessCheck as JWT access check
participant NotificationClient as HttpNotificationServiceClient
participant NotificationsAPI as Notification service REST API
participant PreferenceService as Notification preference application service
participant NotificationProfile as UserNotificationProfile aggregate
participant NotificationProfileRepo as INotificationProfileRepository / MongoNotificationProfileRepository
participant TelegramWebhook as TelegramWebhookController

alt update station alert preferences through API facade
  User->>API: PATCH /users/:id/subscriptions/:stationId
  API->>PreferencesController: route with JWT user
  PreferencesController->>AccessCheck: ensureOwnUserAccess()
  AccessCheck-->>PreferencesController: allowed
  PreferencesController->>NotificationClient: updateAlertPreferences(userId, stationId, alertTypes)
  NotificationClient->>NotificationsAPI: PATCH /notification-preferences/users/:userId/subscriptions/:stationId
  NotificationsAPI->>PreferenceService: update station alert preferences
  PreferenceService->>NotificationProfileRepo: findByUserId(userId)
  NotificationProfileRepo-->>PreferenceService: profile
  PreferenceService->>NotificationProfile: replace selected alert types
  PreferenceService->>NotificationProfileRepo: save(profile)
  NotificationProfileRepo-->>PreferenceService: saved profile
  PreferenceService-->>NotificationsAPI: NotificationProfileResponse
  NotificationsAPI-->>NotificationClient: 200 NotificationProfileResponse
  NotificationClient-->>PreferencesController: profile
  PreferencesController-->>User: 200 UserResponse-compatible profile
else update delivery channels through API facade
  User->>API: PATCH /users/:id/delivery-channels
  API->>PreferencesController: route with JWT user
  PreferencesController->>AccessCheck: ensureOwnUserAccess()
  PreferencesController->>NotificationClient: updateDeliveryChannels(userId, deliveryChannels)
  NotificationClient->>NotificationsAPI: PATCH /notification-preferences/users/:userId/delivery-channels
  NotificationsAPI->>PreferenceService: update delivery channels
  PreferenceService->>NotificationProfileRepo: save(profile)
  NotificationsAPI-->>PreferencesController: NotificationProfileResponse
  PreferencesController-->>User: 200 UserResponse-compatible profile
else link Telegram without manually entering chat id
  User->>API: POST /users/:id/delivery-channels/telegram/link-code
  API->>PreferencesController: route with JWT user
  PreferencesController->>NotificationClient: createTelegramLinkCode(userId)
  NotificationClient->>NotificationsAPI: POST /notification-preferences/users/:userId/delivery-channels/telegram/link-code
  NotificationsAPI->>PreferenceService: create Telegram link code
  PreferenceService->>NotificationProfileRepo: save(profile with link code)
  NotificationsAPI-->>PreferencesController: TelegramLinkCodeResponse
  PreferencesController-->>User: 200 code and bot instructions

  User->>TelegramWebhook: Telegram bot sends /link <code>
  TelegramWebhook->>NotificationProfileRepo: findByTelegramLinkCode(code)
  NotificationProfileRepo-->>TelegramWebhook: profile
  TelegramWebhook->>NotificationProfile: attach Telegram chat id
  TelegramWebhook->>NotificationProfileRepo: save(linked profile)
end
